DOCUMENT(); loadMacros("PGstandard.pl","MathObjects.pl","PGML.pl"); TEXT(beginproblem());
Context("Numeric");
$C = Compute("15"); $phi = Compute("atan(3/4)");
BEGIN_PGML
**Problem 11.** Skriv \(12\sin x + 9\cos x\) som \(C\sin(x+\varphi)\) där \(C\ge 0\) och \(-\pi \le \varphi \le \pi\).

\(C=\) [_]{$C}  
\(\varphi=\) [_]{$phi}
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
